<title>UK: Rabobank sets 100 mln Swiss franc Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 100 mln Swiss franc Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    30.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE  L-30.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   L-LONG FIST COUPON</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBSCRIPTION ENDS 11.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
